 the business; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"11637b8b-94ea-50c2-a10e-f8173dd98201"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.90.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.110","content_hash":"73ad71d535b04f5d0b170d657c2e829305cd5b569895fb724676a788bc0ed41c","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.110:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.110","text":"(iv) A statement as to the number and type of vehicles to be used in the conduct of the business and a description thereof.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"12732242-23a0-5bb6-bc74-a1088e86166b"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.90.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.110","content_hash":"35c50fbcba2fbb1efc8d2f219fe56f195607a19c994980e2a25c1f79cd0db0a5","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.110:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.110","text":"(2) If an applicant for a license as an agent or an employee of a private security firm:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1fb669c0-06f4-516e-98f8-5396b6263ae9"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.90.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.110","content_hash":"837a600677a24b942621a182041af12a38d7dba43a2520bef6835c0c7c134040","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.110:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.110","text":"(i) The applican